<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-066-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.321262" lon="-120.889064"><name>SC26-066-C</name><cmt>SC26-066</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.5 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 49/100; not catch probability. Center 83 ft; nearby 81–98 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-047</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.32367803108909" lon="-120.89059629354611"/><trkpt lat="35.323593679303826" lon="-120.89092847656953"/><trkpt lat="35.323143137657055" lon="-120.89094018205161"/><trkpt lat="35.323047272917115" lon="-120.89061268377927"/><trkpt lat="35.322322568344255" lon="-120.89041152396014"/><trkpt lat="35.32233216259955" lon="-120.89096125126473"/><trkpt lat="35.32260248763205" lon="-120.89095422828719"/><trkpt lat="35.3227002696813" lon="-120.89139167125366"/><trkpt lat="35.3220714292166" lon="-120.89151799988586"/><trkpt lat="35.32197364772814" lon="-120.89108056009414"/><trkpt lat="35.32223054088458" lon="-120.89030392023301"/><trkpt lat="35.32187010763388" lon="-120.89031328693957"/><trkpt lat="35.321783837442716" lon="-120.89053551799833"/><t